{"id":"866e5085ffe52570","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-hornclosure.md","title":"Logical closure of a pure Horn function","display":"df-hornclosure — Logical closure of a pure Horn function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-hornclosure","aliases":["27-df-hornclosure"],"display":"df-hornclosure — Logical closure of a pure Horn function","depends_on":["[[27-df-purehorn]]","[[27-df-truefalse]]","[[27-thm-hornpurechar]]","[[27-thm-hornchar]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-hornclosure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-hornclosure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hornclosure — Logical closure of a pure Horn function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a42b2c2b11efeb04\" href=\"?note=a42b2c2b11efeb04\" title=\"27-df-purehorn\">27-df-purehorn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd6815db60d4efdb\" href=\"?note=cd6815db60d4efdb\" title=\"27-thm-hornpurechar\">27-thm-hornpurechar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" href=\"?note=584eb5a4dd07e7fb\" title=\"27-thm-hornchar\">27-thm-hornchar</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(f)\">\\(F(f)\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a42b2c2b11efeb04\" href=\"?note=a42b2c2b11efeb04\" title=\"27-df-purehorn\">27-df-purehorn</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(f,S)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\{i\\in[n]:a_i=1\\}:a\\in F(f)\\land\\forall j\\in S\\;(a_j=1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(f,S)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\{i\\in[n]:a_i=1\\}:a\\in F(f)\\land\\forall j\\in S\\;(a_j=1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.4.2, discussion following Lemma 6.2 and Remark 6.2，印刷页 285，PDF 第 309 页（从 1 计数）。 合法输入下交的集合族非空，因为 pure Horn 函数的 all-one 点为假；该交仍在假点支持族中。因此定义是表示无关的 logical closure，正好对应书中 S^h。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-purehorn","status":"resolved","id":"a42b2c2b11efeb04","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-purehorn]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornpurechar","status":"resolved","id":"cd6815db60d4efdb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornpurechar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-hornchar","status":"resolved","id":"584eb5a4dd07e7fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornchar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-purehorn","status":"resolved","id":"a42b2c2b11efeb04","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $S\\subseteq[n]$ and $F(f)$ are as in [[27-df-purehorn]] and [[27-df-truefalse]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $S\\subseteq[n]$ and $F(f)$ are as in [[27-df-purehorn]] and [[27-df-truefalse]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornCl}_n(f,S)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\{i\\in[n]:a_i=1\\}:a\\in F(f)\\land\\forall j\\in S\\;(a_j=1)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1145,"backlinks":[{"id":"ff80d886763151d0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$h\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$，$\\eta\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\eta)=h$；$\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-hornclosure]]，$\\mathcal R$ 见 [[27-df-forwardchaining]]。$A\\subseteq[n]$。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-230","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-hornclosure|df-hornclosure — Logical closure of a pure Horn function]]"},{"id":"7a71d4dcf31c11e4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{PureHornDNF}_n$，$h=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{FC}_n$ 见 [[27-df-forwardchaining]]，$\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ 见 [[27-df-hornclosure]]。"},{"id":"9a1bb1aaf7f1b6c3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f\\in\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$, $P,N\\subseteq[n]$, $P\\cap N=\\varnothing$; $T_L$ and $\\mathrm{Imp}$ are defined in [[27-df-term]] and [[27-df-impset]]; $\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-hornclosure]]."},{"id":"271798b3fdcbdca0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PureHorn}_n$ and $\\mathrm{HornCl}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-purehorn]] and [[27-df-hornclosure]]."}],"outgoing":["a42b2c2b11efeb04","98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","cd6815db60d4efdb","584eb5a4dd07e7fb","5d10aed668d85817"]}